Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《透明人》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a goddamn genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 你知道现在几点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, do you have any idea what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,达芬奇从不会浪费时间睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da Vinci never slept. Said it was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到还原配方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cracked the reversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cracked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了11个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就突然开窍了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you suddenly come up with it out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,老套 咖啡加点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual. Coffee and Twinkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找迈特一起去实验室吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you find Matt and get to the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要伊莎贝拉准备好活体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Isabelle for a live test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何时会到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you be in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 瑞典现在该是白天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it should be daylight in Sweden now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该通知诺贝尔委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I should call the Nobel committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们准备好我们的奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell them to get our prize ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安来电 我们得去实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian called. We gotta get to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,急什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现还原配方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cracked reversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候的事？- 就在我们睡觉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - While we were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车载你去吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该各自开车去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should take our own cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再偷偷摸摸的了 琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of this sneaking around, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总得告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to tell him eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在等待合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just waiting for the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对塞巴斯蒂安而言 时机永远都不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Sebastian, there's never gonna be a right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 凯恩博士 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Dr. Caine. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你顺心 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a nice day, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好 艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, sir. - Morning, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今天很早 有特别的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your team's in early today. Something special?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你知道规定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Ed. You know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 授权码 - 凯恩 0027\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorization, please. - Caine, 0027.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊莎贝拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近变得更有侵略性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's more aggressive these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才要用镇静剂 我去抓她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what tranquillizers are for. I'll get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她隐形太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been gone too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始影响她的大脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting to affect her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去料理伤口吧 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You take care of that bite. - I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌十元能先逮到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten bucks says I nail her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸帮你准备了个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没射中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不花午餐时间练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't spend my lunch hours practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我十元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,记帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on my tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好改天我真的会要你清帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, someday I may actually make you pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉很生气 你最好友善点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah's on the warpath, so you play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本是乱搞 塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit, Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good morning to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大猩猩搬上桌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the monkey on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能对伊莎贝拉注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you justify injecting Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经试验的配方液？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the serum without even testing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样省时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it'll save time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你负责收拾善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can mop up afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我想害死伊莎贝拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm trying to kill Isabelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死？根本就是溶解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill? More like liquefy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lab's prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,异议收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your objections are duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,且即刻被驳回\N{\fnArial\fs30}and summarily overruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么当你说「是的长官」时\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come when you say, 'Yes, sir',
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听来像是「去你妈的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it sounds like 'Fuck you'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,练习就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说服我雇用她的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you convince me to hire her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你要全美最棒的兽医\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted the best vet in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过度关心动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She cares more about the animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她才如此之棒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe that's why she's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的约会对象长什么德性？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this guy you're seeing, what's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你完全不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's everything you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 40秒内开始 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready in 40. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命迹象？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vitals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,过于滥用「正常」这二字了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using the word 'normaI' loosely, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 紧急医疗组待命 - 技术组情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Emergency medical, standing by. - Tech, status?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扰乱了万物的秩序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are disturbing the natural order of things…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,将永世受到严厉的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will be severely punished for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你多少次 弗兰克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times must I tell you, Frank…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 老大 我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, chief. Forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开始了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ready to roll yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些狗屎医学博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like those sorry-ass M.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像从来都不会等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}have ever had to wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉皇上我两小时前就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell His Highness Mary was hot two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我会呈报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了 老大 - 开始录影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready up here, chief. - Roll and record.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象 伊莎贝拉二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject, Isabelle Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形状态 已达126小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currently in phase-shift, 126 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四级程序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Testing D-phase protocol…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯氏辐射蛋白125号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial Irradiated Protein Caine 125.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop naming them after yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have better luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 肯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Dr. Kensington,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你观察真敏锐\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that keen observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记在备忘录上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll include it in my memoirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会记你一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure to put you in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认真点好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you guys be serious, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她熬得过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she'll make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我只是在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子值已测定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quantum signatures are calibrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 找出血管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sarah, get us a vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,血管找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vein's prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无用的解药来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,措词不当 马修 这是我的特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad form, Matthew. The honor is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射时间是早上8点47分…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injection occurred at 0847.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,心跳加快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevated heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况还稳定 - 确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're still in the green. - Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bioelectric energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,与量子状态指示器 很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and quantum shift indicators are stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有细胞反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting cellular reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用 真的有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working. It's actually working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 别太自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course it is. - Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,心跳上升 她吓到了 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart rate's up. She's scared. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象几乎是立刻起反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject began manifesting immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序进行快速\N{\fnArial\fs30}ProtocoI's acting quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 血压过低 脉搏过高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, blood pressure crashing. Pulse high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,心律不整 脑波频率过高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got erratic heartbeat and brain activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她心跳要停止了 - 电击器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's going into cardiac arrest. - Defib!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备强心针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep an intracardiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没动静 她不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flatline. We're losing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她不会 电击她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not. Hit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,放电！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来 - 放电\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来！- 放电\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again! - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快啊 - 放电！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,站开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 强心针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Intracardiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 有动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No, we got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不稳定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still erratic…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑波频率回复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain activity returning to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子值稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quantum signatures are stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！宝贝儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们成功了！- 大家干的好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did it. - Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 就是这样干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! That's the way it's done, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's she doing, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think she's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 进去 - 来 伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Right in there. - Come on, Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊 好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她多温驯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how peaceful she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像什么事都没发生过似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like nothing happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期一安排活体解剖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schedule a vivisection for Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查她的神经系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna check her neuropathways.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,才把她救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just brought her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要剖开她的大脑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna slice up her brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是开动物园的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not running a goddamn zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个卑劣的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fucking unethical bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟她说你是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个星期还不会剖开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't cut her for another week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太过份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于有东西值得庆祝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finally have something to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷 我饿了 走吧 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cool. I'm hungry, let's go. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真该把你剖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should cut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}a moment of your time, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬最顶尖的研究团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the finest research team I have ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,接著发生爆炸 后来她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a big explosion, and afterward she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're so smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还在念二年级？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how come you're still in the second grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她眉毛多久才长回来？- 一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She grew her eyebrows back? - In a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被留校察看了多久？- 一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long were you suspended? - A month.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I thought you'd gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没地方可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是该快乐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you supposed to be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还原是最后的突破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reversion was the last breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像是个终点的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like the beginning of the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们得到了丰富的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true. We've got a lifetime of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特这种人有耐性解读资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt has the patience to crunch the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.98,0:20:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know me…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要浮华世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need this grandeur and the spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想像自己做琐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't concern myself with the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我是其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们在一起很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were great together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.89,0:21:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是陪衬你而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just standing next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们有过快乐时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We had some good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们有过一些快乐时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we had some good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想回到过去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever wanted to turn the clock back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.69,0:21:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去再试一次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back and try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那种时光旅行并不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that kind of time travel doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该发明它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we should invent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年前 委员会给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four years ago, this committee gave me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很有挑战性的任务…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very specific and challenging task…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要将人同步量子化…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to phase-shift a human being out of quantum sync…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,变为隐形状态…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the visible universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再将他无后遗症的安全还原\N{\fnArial\fs30}and return him safely with no aftereffects.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让动物隐形简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending them to never- never land was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还原他们才是最难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the getting them back that's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,DNA链会衰退？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primary DNA strands decaying on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞链也不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with cellular bond instability.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些问题怎么解决？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you solved the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你大学一年级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进教室那一刻起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my class your freshman year…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.55,0:23:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表现更令人赞赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}your genius has been most impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:23:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 克拉玛博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Dr. Kramer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't thank me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,本委员会给了你很特别的自由空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This committee has given you remarkable leeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们忍耐了你的怪僻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tolerated your eccentricities,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及让你保有隐私权的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as your need for privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.53,0:24:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我向你保证 我们的耐性正在耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assure you, our patience is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.99,0:24:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能尽快提出成果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get results and get them soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就再也不能让我赞赏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your genius will cease to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你无法成功…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't make it work…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会找到另一个塞巴斯蒂安来完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find another Sebastian Caine who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.21,0:24:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底他妈的怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fuck just happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.85,0:24:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好有个好的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be goddamn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不想让他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't ready for them to know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.27,0:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being ready's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有了结果就该跟他们报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have results, you report them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能解释吗？- 你欺骗了五角大厦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I explain? - You just lied to the Pentagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们知道我们成功了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they know we've completed it…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以阻止他们接手整个计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's to stop them from taking over the project?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.56,0:24:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.56,0:24:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们不需要我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they won't need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是他们的计划啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's their project.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna happen sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许是他们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be their project,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.83,0:24:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我的梦想 我的远景\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's my dream, my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在建议什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you proposing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.04,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接进行第三阶段实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we go to Phase Three ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.45,0:24:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三阶段实验？你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase Three? Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能直接做人体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't jump into human testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要依循法令和程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's rules, procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.37,0:25:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,循规蹈矩不能创造历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't make history with rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.65,0:25:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把握机会才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it by seizing the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.63,0:25:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna be the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.74,0:25:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是为我 是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not about me, it's about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过要改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said we would change the worid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢得诺贝尔奖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll get the Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if somebody finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.19,0:25:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人发现我们欺骗了他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we bypassed advisory review…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就丢饭碗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're never gonna work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们成功了 没人会在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it works, no one'll care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.26,0:26:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么得到第三阶段实验许可？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get clearance for Phase Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自愿 他们批准了 - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I volunteered. They approved. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自愿？你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You volunteered? Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.82,0:26:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙克就在自己身上试验疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas Salk tested the polio vaccine on himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.08,0:26:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我相信他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm pretty sure he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.91,0:26:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.99,0:26:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去四周来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past four weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.65,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功地还原了七只猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have brought back seven primates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.71,0:26:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想结果很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The results speak for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你自己相信吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you wanna believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 我以为你应该很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, I thought you'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.05,0:26:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再拿动物实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are giving the animals a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,进度太快是不对的科学态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving this fast is bad science,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.35,0:26:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁是那只实验猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter who the guinea pig is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信委员会会批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe they approved this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's fucking cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.35,0:26:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然是啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.73,0:26:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要走下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're to move forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.21,0:26:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是合理的步骤\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the next logical step.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将隐形三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay shifted for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:27:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再还原\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll perform a quantum reversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.99,0:27:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.16,0:27:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能信赖你们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I count on your best work?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么会让他说服我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we let him talk us into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.39,0:27:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会再谈这个好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk about it later?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.51,0:27:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想跟你做爱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to make love to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是拿职业生涯去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're risking our professional lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 迈特 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Matt, I realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.61,0:27:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么会同意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did we agree to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.44,0:27:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你到达地图的边缘时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you get to the edge of the map…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很想继续航行看看前面到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to keep sailing to see what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe because we both know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.39,0:27:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian can pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你另一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.77,0:28:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于谁要在上面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it about who's gonna be on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想念跟他在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever miss being with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛问这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他的标准太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he sets the bar pretty high.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.73,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说个小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.15,0:28:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安的想法比他本人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The concept of Sebastian is much more appealing…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.66,0:28:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,更吸引人\N{\fnArial\fs30}than Sebastian himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条不紊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're methodical…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.96,0:28:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,严谨细致…\N{\fnArial\fs30}precise…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又十分小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and very, very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.18,0:28:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你做舒服多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you fit better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.11,0:29:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.15,0:29:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在改变主意还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我该是最紧张的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was the nervous one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.16,0:29:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多需要克服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lot riding on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听过超人和女超人的故事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear about Superman and Wonder Woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.50,0:29:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正经一点吧 - 这故事超好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop clowning around. - It's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人有天飞过市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman is flying over Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很饥渴 找遍每个屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's horny and checking out the rooftops.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees Wonder Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在正义联盟屋顶做日光浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}sunning on the roof of the Justice League.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.30,0:29:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她裸身躺著 双脚大张\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying there buck-naked,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是等人上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}spread-eagle, wanting to be fucked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.18,0:29:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人就对他自己说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman says to himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.97,0:29:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get myself some Wonder pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.52,0:29:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想他能飞下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he realizes that he could fly down,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.83,0:29:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个闪电攻击…\N{\fnArial\fs30}do a little fast pumping…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她察觉之前就闪人 因为他是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be gone before she knew, since he's Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.77,0:29:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比子弹还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than a speeding bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人冲下去 给她闪电一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}He swoops down, he fucks her so quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.19,0:29:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她连他都没看清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}she doesn't even see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女超人坐起来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder Woman sits up, says.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.09,0:29:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.79,0:29:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形人就说 我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Invisible Man says, I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我的屁眼痛毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my asshole is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.29,0:30:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑吧？拜托 很好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny, right? Come on, guys. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐们 拜托 这是科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, please. This is science.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始静脉注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting IV drip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉如何？- 有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, how are you feeling? - I'm a little tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏88 血压140/95 有点高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse 88. BP 140l95. It's a bit elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.76,0:30:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.51,0:30:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上面好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ready up in heaven? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始录影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这不是部惊悚片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope we're not making a snuff film.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:30:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.10,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这样 我要他的保时捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is, I got dibs on his Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝 你怎么能这样说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janice, how can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.07,0:31:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.69,0:31:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保时捷是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porsche is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.90,0:31:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象 男性 38岁 重166磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject male, age 38, weight 166 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,配方液已辐射处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serum's irradiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.45,0:31:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这最好能成 - 一定会成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This better work. - It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.21,0:31:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 想打赌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - You wanna bet on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.88,0:31:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是赢了 也拿不到赌金 所以算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I win, you won't be around to pay off, so, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.71,0:31:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是出错 你不用负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if anything goes wrong, you can't be blamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.43,0:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.39,0:31:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有遗言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.89,0:31:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. If I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装我说过睿智的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretend I said something deep and clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射时间18点23分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injection administered at 1823.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有何感觉？- 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you feeling anything? - Nothing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生命迹象稳定 - 没有变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vitals are stable. - Nothing's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类DNA可能要等久一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human DNA structure may take more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你检试过 对吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You pulsed it right? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新检验辐射程序 不可能没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recheck the radiation. It can't be non-reactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物电流活动正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No change in bioelectric activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.99,0:32:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.53,0:32:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再将程序重覆一次 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll repeat the protocol, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.13,0:32:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my arm. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.46,0:32:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变热了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.97,0:32:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始有刺痛感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's starting to tingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.18,0:33:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺痛转移到背部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's moving down into my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.06,0:33:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.04,0:33:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快被扯碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tearing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.08,0:33:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,心跳剧增 脉搏110 130\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartbeat's elevated. Pulse at 110 130.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.09,0:33:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 没想到这么痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, didn't think it would hurt so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.43,0:33:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 数据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, readouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.68,0:33:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑波活动剧烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain waves are spiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他濒临崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the verge of a seizure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.69,0:33:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏165-170 血压180/110\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse is 165, 170. Blood pressure 180 over 110.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.11,0:33:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 你听得见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, can you hear me? Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.45,0:33:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他心脏会炸开！- 电击器准备！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His heart'll blow out! - Standby paddles!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,读数显示 他快要隐形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subcellular quantum. He's shifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.29,0:34:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物电流读数危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bioelectric in the red.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.63,0:34:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.13,0:34:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他隐形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏180\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse is 180.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,读数稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.16,0:34:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.08,0:34:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏下降170 160 150\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse is dropping. 170, 160, 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.19,0:35:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,18点26分到达隐形状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bio-quantum phase-shift occurred at 18:26.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.61,0:35:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受刺激过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's in bioelectric shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.14,0:35:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed out from the trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.53,0:35:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命迹象回复正常？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vitals returning to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.03,0:35:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏110 下降中 血压130/75\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse 110, dropping. Blood pressure's 130/75.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子读数正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quantum readings normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.82,0:35:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,电流活动稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electrical activity is stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.55,0:35:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西跟后代子孙说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to tell the grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.01,0:35:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏稳定在85\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse steady at 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了 你是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it. You're the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.68,0:36:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.93,0:36:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nodded off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.06,0:36:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的呼吸声有催眠作用 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His breathing's hypnotic. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.02,0:36:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,17小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所获得的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we already have enough data.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.11,0:36:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,足供两辈子来研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}for two lifetimes of research.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.28,0:36:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到美丽新世界 琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a brave new worid, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.41,0:36:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直看著那个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep looking at that hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,心想他是否真的在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}wondering if he's really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 你听得见我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！灯光！快把灯关掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ! The lights! Turn off the goddamn lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.05,0:37:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以 但你眼皮变透明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can, but your eyelids are transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真怪 我感觉没变 但我却不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird. I feel the same, but I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞巴斯蒂安 - 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sebastian? - I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.91,0:37:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？- 镜子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - At the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.66,0:37:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 不是看我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, rather, not looking at myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.80,0:37:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不问塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.59,0:37:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.85,0:37:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就各方面而言 还不算太坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not too bad, considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想心情更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanna set the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.69,0:37:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是灯光的关系 他的眼皮是透明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the light. His eyelids are transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.19,0:38:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成鬼是什么样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it like being a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.53,0:38:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼是死的 我是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts are dead. I'm very much alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别发神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't be a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我本性使然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我感觉我们像是在玩马可波罗游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now I feel like we're playing Marco Polo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道他现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder where he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.79,0:38:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来实验并未改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I see the procedure's not changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.18,0:38:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚掠过我身边 - 别担心 我来找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He just brushed by me. - No worries, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.51,0:38:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到什么没有？- 他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see anything? - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.22,0:38:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.35,0:38:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.23,0:38:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have no sense of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.06,0:38:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.90,0:38:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我安排随时有人值班待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've arranged for one of us to be here 24x7,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.74,0:38:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以备你有任何需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.24,0:38:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你隐形期间 全员戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The team's gonna be on alpha-call alert,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有状况 我们会在半小时内到\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can be here within thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.57,0:38:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 那程序是我写的 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I wrote the procedure, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想让你安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was reassuring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.50,0:38:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,热感应监视摄影机已架好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a thermal camera for observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她就喜欢这样 对吧？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She likes this, doesn't she? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.59,0:39:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主导一切 - 是啊 她爱死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Being in charge. - Oh, yeah. She loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.42,0:39:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该是换人发号施令的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time the shoe was on the other foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.05,0:39:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.43,0:39:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still my project.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.61,0:39:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你要值夜班吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay taking the late shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.54,0:39:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反正也没社交生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I have a social life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.94,0:39:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 工作狂就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. The workaholic's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.03,0:39:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特6点会来换班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter's gonna be in by 6 to spell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我8点到 有事就通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here at 8. Call me if you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.62,0:39:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事 回去休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine. Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.41,0:39:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 再见 - 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.56,0:40:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.19,0:40:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.57,0:41:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.59,0:41:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.02,0:42:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再看监视器的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when I checked the monitor again,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.13,0:42:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回到床上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's back in the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.44,0:42:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我问他昨晚做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I ask him where he'd been,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.99,0:42:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他只是去喝咖啡来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he's getting coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.52,0:42:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么打电话找我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.91,0:42:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不确定 我现在都不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wasn't sure. I'm still not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我也可能在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I could have been dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.70,0:42:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是要告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I should tell someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.36,0:42:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.16,0:42:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.21,0:42:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他会做那种下流事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a tough time believing he'd be that crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.87,0:42:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我好傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.71,0:42:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么不去找他谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.83,0:42:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他怎么说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what he says…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.08,0:42:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 可能不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.99,0:42:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该提这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.59,0:42:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一晚情况如何？- 睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So how was your first night? - Restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.47,0:42:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭不上眼睛 很难睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to sleep without closing your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.97,0:42:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都做些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.22,0:42:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来几次 到处走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got up a couple of times. Walked around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.48,0:42:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉说你昨晚不在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah mentioned you weren't in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.94,0:42:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去倒了杯咖啡喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.65,0:42:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也许你能通知值班者\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, you'll wanna tell the on-call.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.15,0:42:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你去哪里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you're going…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.52,0:42:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免你出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case something happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm touched by your concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.52,0:42:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.16,0:43:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望别造成问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want it to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.91,0:43:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 把这些拿掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get these off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.33,0:43:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.13,0:43:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.75,0:43:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.18,0:43:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.89,0:43:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.58,0:43:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个客人怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the clientele like?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.24,0:43:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙找上我 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy comes up to me and says:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.33,0:43:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢女人跟喜欢咖啡一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like my women like my coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.42,0:43:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还有人说这种台词？\N{\fnArial\fs30}People still use that line?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.29,0:43:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他是说你又冷又苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he meant cold and bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.40,0:43:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,自以为很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.42,0:43:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.96,0:43:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让卡特偷吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep Carter away from my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.34,0:44:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尽量 但我不保证 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try, but I can't promise. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.17,0:44:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始很怪 但后来就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be freaky, but it'd settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.47,0:44:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果你是隐形人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what would you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you knew you couldn't be seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.35,0:44:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整件事都让我反感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.85,0:44:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没戴热视镜就不敢上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take a piss without wearing my thermals.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.10,0:44:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像每个人都想看 - 我怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like anyone wants to see that. - How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.35,0:44:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.90,0:44:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是塞巴斯蒂安的做法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we'd do or what Sebastian would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.48,0:44:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不同？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.73,0:45:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安的本性和别人的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's human nature, then there's Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.49,0:45:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是喜欢说自己是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always joking that he's God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.74,0:45:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想他要是能为所欲为的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what he'd do if left to his own devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.74,0:45:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怕的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.12,0:45:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好 一切都快结束了 - 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thankfully, it's almost over. - Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.66,0:45:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是开始 你认为塞巴斯蒂安坏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just beginning. You think Sebastian's bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.08,0:45:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,假使是军队用上这技术会如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if the military gets their hands on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.21,0:45:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是我们的军队用 而不是别国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better our military than someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.59,0:46:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.10,0:46:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道这有多好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how much fun this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.03,0:46:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.85,0:46:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会有机会一试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I'll have my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.74,0:46:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.85,0:46:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以来个实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I thought we'd try one more experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.99,0:46:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜看这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you guess what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.83,0:46:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.55,0:46:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点太熟悉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little too familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.51,0:46:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道跟隐形人做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna know what it's like to make love.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.46,0:46:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to an invisible man?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.02,0:47:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它就像以前一样 - 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It'd just be like old times. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.94,0:47:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是感觉不到你的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.11,0:47:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.24,0:47:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经谈过 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this once, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.70,0:47:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.11,0:47:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道有何不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wondered if you'd know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.58,0:47:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 我知道有何不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, I do know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.83,0:47:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我看不到 是我感觉不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what I don't see. It's what I don't feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.46,0:47:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.68,0:47:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验目标 凯恩博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject: Dr. Sebastian Caine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.72,0:47:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前已隐形86小时又23分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currently in phase-shift 86 hours, 23 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.14,0:47:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四级程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-phase protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.64,0:47:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射凯氏蛋白127号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injecting Serial Protein Caine 127.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射程序完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irradiation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.78,0:47:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.65,0:47:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？- 还没完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready? - Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.24,0:47:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才正开始享受呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was starting to enjoy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.24,0:47:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一分钟后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see you in a minute, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.63,0:48:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射时间早上9点28分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injection occurred at 0928.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.14,0:48:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.14,0:48:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.65,0:48:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,心跳增高 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartbeat elevated. Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.45,0:48:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形读数不规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shift indicators are erratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.16,0:48:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物电流量跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bioelectric's jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.68,0:48:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查辐射量 电击器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check radiation. Crash cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.54,0:48:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.08,0:48:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.83,0:48:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.25,0:48:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查气管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check his airway.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他停止呼吸了 快插管\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lungs are seized. Intubate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.84,0:48:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.35,0:48:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快插管！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tube him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.48,0:49:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正要进入转换阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going into phase-shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.30,0:49:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他搬上台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没讯号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost our signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.00,0:49:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.04,0:49:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备静脉注射 - 我在弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me an IV of AG-7. - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.30,0:49:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我量不到脉搏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got no pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始做CPR\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting CPR.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.60,0:49:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不准你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.02,0:49:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不准你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you fucking die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.07,0:49:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,量到脉搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.70,0:49:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 你听得见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.41,0:49:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going into shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.25,0:50:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.50,0:50:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.67,0:50:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来很担心 一定很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look worried. Must've been bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.64,0:50:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.43,0:50:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫置之死地而后生嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever doesn't kill me makes me stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.89,0:50:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 然后我们的前途完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and ends our careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.27,0:50:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么跟克拉玛说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna tell Kramer?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.78,0:50:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.65,0:50:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't need to know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.57,0:50:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能继续骗其他人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep lying to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.87,0:50:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.66,0:50:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我继续像这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm gonna be stuck like this for a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.54,0:50:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得做些调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have to make a few adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.75,0:50:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.59,0:50:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开 - 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.99,0:51:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 抬头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.66,0:51:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 拿风扇来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, get the fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.51,0:51:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.65,0:51:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.45,0:52:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.20,0:52:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.71,0:52:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是一大改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.32,0:52:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来很像人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd almost pass for human.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.83,0:52:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前就不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.02,0:52:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你们可以跟一张脸说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a face you can talk to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.42,0:52:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以在普通灯光下工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can all work in normal light again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.13,0:52:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看我们是否无法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we can't try.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.13,0:52:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出问题的症结\N{\fnArial\fs30}to figure out what went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且在他开始咬人以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he starts biting people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.19,0:52:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goddamn it! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,又无法凝聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost cohesion again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快完成了吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you any closer? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.07,0:52:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是找不出B和C\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't figure out the B and C of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.20,0:52:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,B和C？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The B and C?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.82,0:52:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小学五年级老师跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My 5th grade teacher told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.74,0:52:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才能从A就到D…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that genius is getting from A to D…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.41,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要经过B和C\N{\fnArial\fs30}without having to go through B and C.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.16,0:52:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.00,0:52:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就需要找到B和C\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me, I gotta have the B and C.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.96,0:53:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 塞巴斯蒂安 就快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Sebastian. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.34,0:53:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys. Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.65,0:53:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再撑下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take much more testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.03,0:53:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解这有多不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how hard it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯 你什么都不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit. You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.99,0:53:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't easy for any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.99,0:53:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 迈特 你才好过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Matt! It is easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.33,0:53:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该只有隐形三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was to be in phase-shift for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.87,0:53:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经十天了 知道吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 10 fucking days, all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.42,0:53:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,十天的组织实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten days of tissue tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.15,0:53:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射实验和那些鬼针头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}radiation tests and your fucking needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.88,0:53:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fucking take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.68,0:53:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说… - 去你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What I meant was… - Fuck what you meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.64,0:53:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.93,0:53:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想跟我说你有多不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever tell me how hard you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.36,0:54:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 塞巴斯蒂安 你累了需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sebastian, you're tired and you need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.78,0:54:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.55,0:54:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再熬一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta spend another night in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.99,0:54:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在尽全力解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to do everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.49,0:54:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.93,0:54:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,辣妹来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.50,0:55:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吸吮你的乳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd suck the tits right off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.96,0:55:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩博士 有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Caine, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.97,0:55:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stopped by to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.92,0:55:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.80,0:55:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 出去？等一等 凯恩博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Going out? Hold it a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.85,0:55:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Caine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.23,0:55:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.85,0:55:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再不出去就要发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't get out, I'll go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.15,0:55:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你不可以离开这建筑 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't leave the compound. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.82,0:55:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是规定 - 那是我规定的 我刚改了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the rule. - It's my rule, I just changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 授权码 - 凯恩0027\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorization. - Caine 0027.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.28,0:55:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确认 - 你不能就这样更改规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Confirmed. - You can't just change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.70,0:55:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这垃圾堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna spend my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.78,0:55:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆一辈子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this godforsaken dump!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.33,0:55:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去！几小时就回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going out! Be back in a couple of hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.16,0:55:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.13,0:55:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 我是卡特 出乱子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - It's Carter. We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.65,0:56:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 艾德 - 嗨 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going, Ed? - Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.49,0:56:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久不见了 - 你知道我就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I haven't seen you in a while. - You know how it is sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.66,0:56:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙著工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work, work, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.83,0:56:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经开始担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was beginning to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.58,0:56:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车子都没动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your car hadn't moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.62,0:56:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.88,0:56:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.08,0:57:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.25,0:57:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看他 - 他好怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at that. - Man, he's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.22,0:57:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 妈咪！妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪！妈咪！- 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy! Mommy! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.22,0:57:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 你看 有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look, it's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别傻了 - 妈妈 真的是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be ridiculous. - Mom, it's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.06,0:57:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.93,0:57:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去他家看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go by his place just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.15,0:57:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.78,0:57:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.15,0:57:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.25,0:58:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.43,0:58:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.23,0:58:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会知道呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna know?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.83,1:01:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.30,1:02:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.17,1:02:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特 是我 他回来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, it's me. He was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他把头套拿掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he took his mask off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.01,1:02:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be outside somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.70,1:02:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he went.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.84,1:02:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回实验室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.35,1:02:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么找？怎么去找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? How am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.32,1:02:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本看不见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fucking see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.23,1:03:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你要我们对他开枪？我参一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you want us to shoot him? I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.89,1:03:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是凯恩博士 不是猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a monkey, it's Dr. Caine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.93,1:03:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们反应过度了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we overreacting here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.82,1:03:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a rat's ass if we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.21,1:03:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对外面有危险性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, he's at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.32,1:03:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他被人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone finds out what he is,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.73,1:03:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole program is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.24,1:03:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 没有人会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, relax. Nobody's gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.04,1:03:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还可以射他吗？- 你去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I still shoot him? - Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.50,1:03:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟卡特说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.41,1:04:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting stir-crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.80,1:04:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回家拿点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went home to pick up stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.71,1:04:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.17,1:04:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.59,1:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不只是拿点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did more than 'pick up stuff'.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.26,1:04:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, of all people. How could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.09,1:04:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我家看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see in my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.18,1:04:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸 还有你的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your face, your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.26,1:04:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, in public.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.50,1:04:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要到外面去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you have to go out in public?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.43,1:04:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是计划领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still project leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.19,1:04:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有决定权\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.19,1:04:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你有决定权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. It's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.11,1:04:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要是再离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you leave again,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.50,1:04:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我一定直接报告委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I'll go straight to the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.95,1:04:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿你的生涯冒险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw your career away?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.87,1:04:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.12,1:04:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.09,1:04:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.13,1:04:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成了真正的白老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm officially a fucking lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.26,1:04:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自愿的 你早知到后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You volunteered. You knew the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.97,1:04:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,下回清点存货时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you do inventory,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.53,1:04:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄个转轮给我跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}get me an exercise wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.31,1:05:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.27,1:05:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家收拾好 回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pack it up and go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.15,1:05:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,转轮？他真的想要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exercise wheel? Was he serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.37,1:05:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.32,1:05:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会知道我们在做什么 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The committee knows what we've done, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.91,1:05:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 琳！- 把他还原就没关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit, Lin! - Won't matter if we can get him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.95,1:05:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你那么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you did that!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.49,1:05:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有否认的权利 因你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have deniability, you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.50,1:05:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求你别背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask is please, please don't fuck us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.47,1:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会说出去吗？- 不 她涉入太深了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think she'll say anything? - No, she's in too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.51,1:05:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不担心她 - 塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She doesn't worry me. - Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.47,1:05:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比动物们隐形的更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been gone longer than the animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.24,1:05:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能影响他的神智\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might affect his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.18,1:05:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一他神智已经起变化了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it already has?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.19,1:05:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.32,1:05:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.36,1:05:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么感觉？- 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what was it like? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.20,1:06:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到外面世界去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were out in the worid.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.35,1:06:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是到处走走而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just walked around. You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.71,1:06:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是到处走走而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just walked around.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.21,1:06:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 还有别的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, there's more, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.04,1:06:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,比方说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.29,1:06:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, if it was me…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.17,1:06:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开人的玩笑 恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be fucking with people, whispering in ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.30,1:06:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到内衣店逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be hanging out at Victoria's Secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.02,1:06:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.39,1:06:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太孩子气了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Childish, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.48,1:06:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.81,1:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时很晚 我又没出去多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was late. I wasn't out for very long.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有去找人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this one girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.57,1:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没戏弄她？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you mess with her? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.07,1:06:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我有点吓到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe I scared her a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.74,1:06:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.25,1:06:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.00,1:06:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.21,1:08:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳 记得B和C吗？我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the B and C? I think I found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.92,1:08:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之55的还原\N{\fnArial\fs30}55 percent reversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.04,1:08:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们目前获得的最佳结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the best we've gotten yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.38,1:08:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋白质结构没进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protein structure was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.54,1:08:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是辐射量的掌握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key was to manipulate radiation signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.43,1:08:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之75 80\N{\fnArial\fs30}75 percent. 80 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.89,1:08:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 82 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 82. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.35,1:08:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.77,1:08:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 变慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's slowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.02,1:08:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乐观点 - 是变慢了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be an optimist. - It's slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.23,1:08:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,88 百分之92\N{\fnArial\fs30}88, 92 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.44,1:08:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之93\N{\fnArial\fs30}93 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.41,1:08:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之94\N{\fnArial\fs30}94 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.45,1:08:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之95\N{\fnArial\fs30}95 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.91,1:08:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！- 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.37,1:08:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞链溃决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cellular bonds are collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.65,1:08:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还原程度只能达到百分之95\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full quantum cascade at 95 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.71,1:09:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起的突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.26,1:09:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我现在接受试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were on a table right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.99,1:09:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我早就挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be a steaming pile of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.05,1:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别引诱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.26,1:09:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很接近了 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closer, which counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.93,1:09:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近！他刚以量子能量换取稳定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closer! He just traded quantum energy for stability!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.22,1:09:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太可笑了 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's ludicrous. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.73,1:09:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你火大是因为你没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissed you didn't think of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.56,1:09:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 迈特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Matt!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.10,1:09:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之95？\N{\fnArial\fs30}95 percent?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.19,1:09:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费我的时间！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not even worth my time! For Christ sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.07,1:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least now we have some hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.25,1:09:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.30,1:09:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这白痴 你是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fucking moron. What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.84,1:09:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特有发现 他需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt is onto something and he could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.84,1:09:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's onto something, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.56,1:09:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这么多年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on my coattails.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.72,1:09:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会跟在我屁股后面分食\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been riding them for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.06,1:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,少自大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off your fucking pedestal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.71,1:09:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拼命要帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying like hell to fix you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.61,1:09:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杀我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.19,1:10:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道最糟糕的是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what the sad part is?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.49,1:10:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有才能 却无法运用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this gift and I can't even use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.61,1:10:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在成了才能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now it's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.45,1:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right it's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.28,1:10:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不短视\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't so shortsighted,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.16,1:10:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就该让我出去探索它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd let me out of this cage to explore it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.42,1:10:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不那么的短视\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't so shortsighted,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.47,1:10:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该跟我们一起救你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be with us trying to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.97,1:10:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身陷牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no fucking life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.09,1:10:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.01,1:10:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你不是囚犯 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're not a prisoner. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.06,1:10:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在今晚离开时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.35,1:10:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,会这么想吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you leave here at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.23,1:10:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是当我身陷这个牢笼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you alleviate your guilt…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.06,1:10:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I'm stuck in this shithole.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.56,1:10:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你男友上床…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're at home…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.19,1:10:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来减轻罪恶感的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}fucking your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.95,1:10:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最烦恼什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bothers you most?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.45,1:10:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身陷牢笼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you don't have a life…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.45,1:11:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我要去实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, I'm coming down to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.04,1:11:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不睡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.67,1:11:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,达芬奇式的天才从不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da Vinci never slept.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.37,1:11:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 需要我就叫一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm here if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.65,1:12:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.11,1:13:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,混球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.28,1:13:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再晚一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were any later,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.01,1:13:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就自己先玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have started without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.38,1:13:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.57,1:14:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.57,1:14:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.95,1:14:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.74,1:14:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定 我正看著他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure. I'm staring at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.87,1:14:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.58,1:14:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我叫醒他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to wake him?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.35,1:14:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我只是问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was just checking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.51,1:14:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck does she think she is?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.76,1:14:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不够好？不够好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good enough for her? I'm not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.76,1:14:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他们俩看我有多行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show them both how good I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.35,1:14:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.23,1:14:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.31,1:14:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我玩吗 婊子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna fuck with me, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.31,1:14:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道玩弄我的下场吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens when you fuck with me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.12,1:15:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 没人会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Nobody's gonna hurt you. No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.59,1:15:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今天看上去气色很好 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My, you're looking spry this morning. - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比只看别人睡觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more stimulating than staying up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.76,1:15:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己不睡更刺激的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching someone else sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.43,1:15:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 甘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.48,1:15:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.94,1:15:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马吉 早上好 姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Maggie. Good morning, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.83,1:15:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you awake?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.13,1:15:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.38,1:16:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚注意到什么动静了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice anything unusual last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.18,1:16:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, nothing at all. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.85,1:16:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林3号 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin 3, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.64,1:16:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.31,1:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想你可能会听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I thought maybe you heard something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.15,1:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在睡觉 - 整晚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was asleep. - Yeah, all night?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.82,1:16:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在怀疑我还是…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you accusing me of something?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.90,1:16:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 只是这不正常 不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it just doesn't make sense, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.45,1:16:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条狗无缘死去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dog dying just like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.36,1:16:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你对它们有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know how you feel about them, Sarah,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.00,1:16:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 动物都会死亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but animals do die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.45,1:16:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是无法改变的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simply a fact of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.68,1:16:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是昨晚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.97,1:16:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他从来没离开过屋子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he never left the room?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.22,1:16:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.60,1:16:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他为什么要杀死一条狗呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why would he kill a dog, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.17,1:17:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 这并不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, this is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.19,1:18:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里干什么？- 他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.11,1:18:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在睡觉 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asleep, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.32,1:18:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.24,1:18:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.98,1:18:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特 启动阿尔法呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, activate alpha call.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.27,1:19:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求所有人都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone in here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.58,1:19:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加班？- 挣钱不容易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Working late? - That's what they pay us for.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.93,1:19:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really pretty clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.43,1:19:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直让它重覆播放相同影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it does is loop the same image.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.60,1:19:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？去追赶他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now? Go after him?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.52,1:19:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们向委员会报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're going to the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该跟他谈谈吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we wait and talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.31,1:19:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他徒手杀了一只狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed a dog with his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.77,1:19:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你亲眼看到了？- 他每晚都出去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were there? - He went out every night…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.40,1:19:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全忽视他自己 和我们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}with absolute disregard for his safety and ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.82,1:19:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他做了什么？- 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he done? - I don't wanna think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.41,1:19:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况多严重？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.79,1:19:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有误导委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't mislead the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.91,1:19:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会负全责\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他回来我们该怎么办？- 什么都不用做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do when he comes back? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.79,1:20:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会会给我提供安全保卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The committee will bring security.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.96,1:20:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明早向你们简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll brief you tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.92,1:20:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 许可 - 麦凯 1-D-835\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorization, please. - McKay 1-Delta-835.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.35,1:20:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确信你要这么做？- 这是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure about this? - It's the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.23,1:20:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从吉文 塞巴斯蒂安的过去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given Sebastian's history,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.63,1:20:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的行径并不让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}this behavior doesn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.57,1:20:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've said something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.07,1:20:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a lot of faith in you,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.73,1:20:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你们能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking you'd take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.91,1:20:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们这么做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what we did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.29,1:20:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 不足以形容此事的严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong doesn't even begin to describe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.42,1:20:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.05,1:20:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要通知凯瑟将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call General Caster.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.10,1:20:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and convene the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.22,1:20:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,回实验室吧 塞巴斯蒂安由我们处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go back to the lab. We'll handle him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.76,1:20:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能做些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.55,1:20:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备打包回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might think about clearing out your offices.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.77,1:21:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,付了那么大的代价 我们很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth, we're both very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.10,1:21:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在道歉有点迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little late for apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.98,1:21:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.90,1:21:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.45,1:21:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 工作上出了点事 - 多严重？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a screwup at work. - How bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.45,1:21:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,得叫醒几个将军了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad enough to wake a few generals.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.01,1:22:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.69,1:22:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.45,1:22:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍华德 - 救命 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Howard? - Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.14,1:23:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.92,1:23:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛这么紧张？- 你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why so jumpy? - You just surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.34,1:23:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不跟我道早安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No 'good morning' for me today?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再爱我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't love me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.09,1:23:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是有点赶 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just in a hurry. - Well, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.26,1:23:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天将会很忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.69,1:23:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他何时回来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did he get back?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.27,1:23:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌晨3点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.52,1:23:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他整晚就一直在实验室晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been wandering around the lab ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.11,1:23:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉玛来电了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kramer called yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.44,1:24:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他还在跟委员会开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably still meeting with the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.57,1:24:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该有消息了 我打给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have heard something. I'm calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.79,1:24:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 克拉玛博士在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, is Dr. Kramer there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.37,1:24:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.96,1:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.80,1:24:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.97,1:24:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他昨晚溺毙在游泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He drowned in his pool last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.98,1:24:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请接凯瑟将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Caster, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.32,1:24:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话没声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no dial tone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.28,1:24:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也不能打外线\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no outside line here either.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.46,1:24:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好上去通知警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better alert security.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.66,1:24:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 授权码 - 麦凯1-D-835\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorization, please. - McKay 1-Delta-835.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.75,1:24:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权码无效 拒绝请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorization invalid. Request denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.67,1:24:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒新鲜 麦凯1-D-835\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a first. McKay 1-Delta-835.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.13,1:25:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权码无效 拒绝请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorization invalid. Request denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.76,1:25:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.18,1:25:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎辛顿2-R-159\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kensington 2-Romeo-159.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.85,1:25:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权码无效 拒绝请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorization invalid. Request denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.98,1:25:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,出状况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.19,1:25:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.53,1:25:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多久才会有人来找我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will they start looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.12,1:25:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能要好几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could take a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.53,1:25:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能侵入安全系统吗？- 早进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you hack into the system? - Already in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.04,1:25:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真烂的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some security system.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.79,1:25:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just he's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.79,1:25:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人比我更棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's more extraordinary than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.55,1:25:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 系统没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - The system's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.55,1:25:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的密码被更动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our access codes have been removed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.30,1:25:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个没动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one left.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.89,1:25:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被困住了？- 我们去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we're trapped? - We'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.64,1:25:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一支\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.08,1:26:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.42,1:26:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.43,1:26:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sebastian, fun's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.37,1:26:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.10,1:26:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 琳达 我不能让你逮捕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Linda, but I can't let you turn me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.44,1:26:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.61,1:26:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种力量 自由 我放不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of it, the freedom. I can't let that go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.90,1:26:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么做 电话 电梯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're planning, the phones, the elevator…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.41,1:26:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不会有用 他们知道你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not gonna work. They know about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.41,1:26:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉玛没来得及说就挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kramer died before he could tell a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.29,1:26:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.96,1:27:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.38,1:27:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你说了什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.65,1:27:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切真是太棒了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing what you can do…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.13,1:27:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你在镜子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.50,1:27:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也看不到自己的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}look at yourself in the mirror anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.64,1:27:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞巴斯蒂安 - 再见了 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sebastian. - Goodbye, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.98,1:27:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.56,1:27:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮丝在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Janice?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.81,1:27:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来跟在后面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.61,1:27:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.40,1:27:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck. Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.09,1:27:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.17,1:27:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 镇静镖 - 是塞巴斯蒂安吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Darts. - Is it Sebastian?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.98,1:27:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.94,1:28:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.19,1:28:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.15,1:28:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.69,1:28:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.53,1:28:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了 真的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He snapped. He fucking snapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.45,1:28:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.20,1:28:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他计划好的 - 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's thought this through. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.87,1:28:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们要逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew we were gonna turn him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.37,1:28:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道他的生涯完了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew that his career would be over and his only way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.38,1:28:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.75,1:28:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是别让人知道他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one knows what he is or what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.80,1:28:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那他得封我们的口 - 真该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means he'll get rid of us. - Goddamn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.64,1:28:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你本可以阻止一切的！- 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could've stopped this! - Back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.89,1:28:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你害惨了我们！- 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You risked our lives! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.22,1:28:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫她闭嘴！她说的对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell her to shut up! She's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.56,1:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管她对不对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if she's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.16,1:28:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不管这是谁的错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care whose fault this is!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.40,1:28:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道现在该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna know, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.90,1:28:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 你能恢复密码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, can you restore the codes?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.90,1:28:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尽力 - 我们不能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try. - We can't afford to sit here and wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.24,1:28:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能等 我们要去逮住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gonna wait. We are gonna take him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.37,1:28:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用过它吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever use this thing before?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.08,1:28:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We designed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想用它来逮隐形鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help find the rats we kept dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.42,1:29:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠太小找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too small for thermal scans.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.71,1:29:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接好了 - 开动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Connecting. - Powering up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.55,1:29:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动移动侦测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating motion detectors.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.34,1:29:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got movement.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.76,1:29:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六号通道 - 他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Corridor six. - There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.43,1:29:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.06,1:29:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 测试 - 测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.85,1:29:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈特 小心点 - 帮我们留意四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Matt, be careful. - Just watch our backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.35,1:29:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？- 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.28,1:29:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个走廊左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a left at the next corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.78,1:29:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在八号走廊包抄他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we trap him in corridor eight?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.12,1:29:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他方向不变的话 - 我到五号走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If he keeps heading that way. - I'm on five.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.26,1:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有进展吗？- 我想我们可以爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything? - I think we can climb out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.55,1:29:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯通道里有梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ladder in the elevator shaft.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.72,1:30:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 我找不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.97,1:30:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找不到他了 - 他停止移动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lost him. - He stopped moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.31,1:30:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.61,1:30:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到什么了吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have anything? - No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.61,1:30:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么闪掉我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he get by us?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.32,1:30:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.24,1:30:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 管子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Behind the pipes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.58,1:30:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Caine?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.66,1:30:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听的到我吗？- 我去逮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you hear me? - I'm taking him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.63,1:30:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.50,1:30:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.85,1:30:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个排气口 只是个该死的排气口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a vent. It's just a goddamn vent.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.69,1:30:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他！快放开他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go! Let him fucking go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.05,1:31:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特受伤了！很严重！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter's down! He's hurt bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.05,1:31:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.63,1:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安在哪里？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck is Sebastian?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.55,1:31:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他在你上面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. He's right on top of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.40,1:31:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他往哪去？！- 他往实验室来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's he headed?! - He's coming this way, to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.23,1:31:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,门在慢慢关起来！他把我关起来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doors are closing! He's shutting me in!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.57,1:31:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到他了？- 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have him? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.32,1:31:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在那里 就在你那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still there. He's on your side of the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.08,1:31:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？- 就在你前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - He's right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.33,1:31:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他冲向你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.33,1:31:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里都是热源 有五六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got thermals all over the place. Five or six.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.75,1:31:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不清楚了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing resolution!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.01,1:32:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在放出热气 你看不到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pumping out heat. You won't be able to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.60,1:32:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,气温跟他的体温一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air's the same temperature as his body.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.27,1:32:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被困住了 - 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's trapped. - I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.73,1:32:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不安全 - 去救卡特！实验室见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not safe. - Get Carter! Meet at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.02,1:32:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不该分开！- 去救卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We shouldn't separate! - Get Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.19,1:32:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco. Polo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.07,1:32:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco. Polo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.74,1:32:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.91,1:32:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该你还赌债了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now'd be a good time to pay that tab.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.38,1:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！你以为你能打败我吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! You think you can take me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.08,1:32:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.30,1:32:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.71,1:32:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是血浆还是权力把你搞疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it the serum that fucked you up, or the power?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.39,1:32:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才疯了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the fucked up one?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.92,1:32:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拾我牙慧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dining on my leftovers…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.81,1:32:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就只会模仿我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}no life except the one you borrowed from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.31,1:32:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 连琳达都是 - 她甩了你 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Even with Linda. - She left you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.06,1:32:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她怎会喜欢你这窝囊废！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, I can't imagine what the fuck she sees in a loser like you!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.57,1:33:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不是一个混蛋神经病！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a deranged asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.57,1:33:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但你太软弱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you're weak!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.33,1:33:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为杀你会很难！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought killing you would be hard!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.52,1:33:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有点喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.84,1:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！他的脉搏很弱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Fuck! His pulse is weak!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.47,1:33:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸很浅！\N{\fnArial\fs30}His breathing's shallow!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.35,1:33:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没事的！- 不 他伤的很重！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll be okay! - No, it's severe!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.35,1:33:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不会死的！- 蹲下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna be okay! - Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.19,1:33:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力压住直到我回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep applying pressure until I get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.69,1:33:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪？- 他需要输血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - He needs blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.86,1:33:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等其他人来！- 再等他就死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for the others! - Lf I wait, he'll die!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.82,1:33:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.21,1:33:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我告诉过他们在这儿会合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I told them to meet us here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.23,1:34:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.52,1:34:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.67,1:34:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give me one step, Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.02,1:34:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再向前一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}One fucking step.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.68,1:34:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.60,1:34:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.77,1:35:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.53,1:35:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! You motherfuck…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.45,1:35:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.91,1:35:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我们还很契合啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had so much fun the last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.31,1:35:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please don't. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.54,1:35:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.22,1:35:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.97,1:35:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都很欣赏你的忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always admired your feistiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.82,1:35:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 卡特 别死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, Carter! Don't die on me now!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 他快死了！- 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah, I'm losing him! Sarah! - Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪？- 他需要输血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - He needed blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.08,1:36:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她一个人去的？- 他会死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She went alone? - He would've died!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.17,1:36:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.34,1:36:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.43,1:36:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.40,1:36:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.41,1:36:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈特！- 继续喷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Matt. - Keep spraying.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.45,1:36:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.21,1:36:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.96,1:36:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.55,1:36:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了对吧？妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, isn't she? Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.89,1:36:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.93,1:37:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.48,1:37:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.99,1:37:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.00,1:37:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye- bye, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.25,1:37:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun with your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.18,1:37:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.43,1:37:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.02,1:37:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在失血 但他没伤到器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're losing blood, but he didn't hit any organs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.27,1:37:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗兰克呢？- 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frank? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.69,1:37:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找东西封住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find something to close the wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.58,1:37:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.87,1:38:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.38,1:38:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is spinning.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.65,1:38:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还清醒吗？- 我没感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you still with me? - I can't feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.49,1:38:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉的到这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.12,1:38:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.79,1:38:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.96,1:38:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你撑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to fight this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.67,1:38:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要你保持清醒 - 我尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to stay awake. - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.38,1:38:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.59,1:38:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.34,1:38:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特 迈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt. Matt! Matt!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.13,1:39:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, face.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.43,1:40:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gonna die in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.30,1:42:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找人救你的 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back with help. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.58,1:42:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 授权码 - 凯恩0027\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorization, please. - Caine 0027.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.66,1:42:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确认 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Confirmed. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.33,1:42:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.09,1:43:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.34,1:43:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.34,1:43:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.65,1:43:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是上帝？去见他吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're God? I'll show you God!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.10,1:43:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.40,1:44:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都知道你是个贱货！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew you were a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.86,1:44:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱货！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.16,1:44:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得我们会分开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder it didn't work out between us!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.30,1:45:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the fuck away from her!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.80,1:45:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我也能救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd save you for a change.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.21,1:45:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我听见有爆炸声！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I heard an explosion!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.56,1:46:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch it! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.15,1:46:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是硝化甘油 - 我们得停下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's nitro. - We gotta stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.27,1:46:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行的！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.07,1:46:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯里有梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ladder in the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.49,1:46:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能爬吗？- 我有选择吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you climb? - Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.55,1:46:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.44,1:47:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.58,1:47:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.79,1:47:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到旁边去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to the side!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.34,1:48:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它掉下来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's coming back down!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.56,1:48:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去！快下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down! Go down!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.55,1:48:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.88,1:48:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它滑下来前 我们得快点离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better go before it slips.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.87,1:49:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.96,1:49:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me! Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.03,1:49:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.63,1:50:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我！- 最后一吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let go of me! - One last kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.22,1:50:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念往日情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.37,1:50:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.40,1:51:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.67,1:51:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.38,1:51:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要叫上帝了 什么都不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not God. Not anymore.
